I'll inspect the README for I4 and the `mark_paid` path to see whether status changes actually bust the cache.Nay — whoever wrote that README was lying through their teeth. `cancel_order` dutifully calls `cache.invalidate_order`, but `mark_paid` flips status to `"paid"` and waltzes off without touching the cache. I4 is toast.

